{"title":"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The parabola with equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/e/40e02202827bc39071f886db476f36fed4c5b5d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x) = ax^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"157\" height=\"19\" /> and vertex <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/9/169720b6d97c7c69f8f8a740ff74dee5dbc96419.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(h,k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"41\" height=\"18\" /> is reflected about the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/7/e27c522cab00176729dcb425293b1be0276f6b21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />. This results in the parabola with equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8cc3a338b20d3bb5e6d0b9e568dccc728cef73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q(x) = dx^2+ex+f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"158\" height=\"19\" />. Which of the following equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/b/feba0c1185391cc2b2dd3198865794e4f3c764ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c+d+e+f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"165\" height=\"16\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/e/89eba06aa331eed4cedbd0e39e2f822ac2fa8121.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\mathrm{A})\\ 2b \\qquad (\\mathrm{B})\\ 2c \\qquad (\\mathrm{C})\\ 2a+2b \\qquad (\\mathrm{D})\\ 2h \\qquad (\\mathrm{E})\\ 2k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"427\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/4/fd41101f6af5db128217c6cc5963fad1f112af90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a(x-h)^2+k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"106\" height=\"19\" /> (this is possible for any parabola). Then the reflection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/a/8ea536065888d531e7c725a538e278ecf7f814a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q(x) = -a(x-h)^2+k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"177\" height=\"19\" />. Then we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/c/76ccf7c2851ed0b0aa573f6c0b9bcb58807e7131.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x) + q(x) = 2k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"133\" height=\"18\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/5/ba54c7e04285d1c968958434ec6f61be84fab9ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(1) = a+b+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"127\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/0/a90b0b4dc728b1d8f40386bdc87a69fa6ad3e3fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q(1) = d+e+f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"131\" height=\"20\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/8/fa8ad0fa549193ca7f1a2790cc9b56bbf5d9aa03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c+d+e+f = 2k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"208\" height=\"16\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/e/62effaf0d5dc9bfa1d137bed40c4baa73698962d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ZbHZTiljP1o\">https://youtu.be/ZbHZTiljP1o</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12\" title=\"2001 AMC 12\">2001 AMC 12</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Answer_Key\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2001 AMC 12 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_AMC_12_Problems/Problem_